                            {
                                "example_id": "2b75c12f-3f15-4802-b8cf-dfede8a37b96",
                                "sense_id": "a0cf7d90-ebc0-3d81-b204-f12b2a720317",
                                "text": "The notion of gentrification is interesting in that it puts emphasis on both the dynamics of the social divisions of space, and on the complexity of the patterns involved, which relate both to social and to urban change."
